        {
            "language": "en-gb",
            "numericRating": 5,
            "content": "I had an amazing time with Giulio learning about Rome, photography and travels!  He was extremely patient with my many questions and made the whole experience a lot of fun.  If you are into seeing Rome's amazing history and taking some great photos this is the tour for you.  I highly recommend making sure you book with Giulio!",
            "id": "masked_e623748c-b6af-459a-bc7b-837b90ed1635",
            "epochMs": 1674563400000,
            "__typename": "AttractionsReview",
