            "__typename": "AttractionsReview",
            "isApproved": true,
            "rating": null,
            "providerName": "viator",
            "content": "A thoroughly wonderful experience , with such a knowledgeable and friendly guide . Giving us insight into the architecture and history of what we were photographing and making the entire experience so personal and engaging . I cannot recommend this experience highly enough. ",
            "language": "en-gb",
            "numericRating": 5,
            "epochMs": 1669383243000,
            "id": "masked_5dbd9ee5-80a8-4a08-865b-9df13708ccf5",
            "date": "11/25/2022, 05:34:03"
        },
        {
            "votes": null,
            "user": {
                "avatar": null,
                "name": "masked_12871dcf-6a98-4d25-bfc2-3718ca757383",
                "__typename": "AttractionsReviewUser",
                "cc1": ""
            },
            "__typename": "AttractionsReview",
            "isApproved": true,
            "rating": null,
            "providerName": "viator",
            "content": "Our great experience started even before our tour.  Giulio was a fantastic communicator, gave us all the information we needed, and set the stage for what to expect.  We expected a photographer, and we got a FABULOUS photographer, great communicator, historian, and a kind man with a great sense of humor.  We not only connected personally, but got some fantastic night photography shots.  He knew right where to go, when to be there, what angle to use, what camera settings are best....everything we expected, and MORE.  Then there was the pesky \"camera not working\" issue, which Giulio quickly diagnosed and fixed, saving the day.  We will most definitely use Giulio again for another tour, and highly recommend him to anyone, from beginner to advanced who wants to capture Rome and have a lifetime of memories.",
            "numericRating": 5,
            "language": "en-gb",
            "epochMs": 1667479098000,
            "id": "masked_7880ed94-f5b5-4feb-8cde-4a5ef0a7e843",
            "date": "11/03/2022, 05:38:18"
        },
        {
            "id": "masked_818e520d-9cc8-4e3b-af06-df796279068c",
            "epochMs": 1663133338000,
            "language": "en-gb",
            "numericRating": 5,
            "content": "Such a wonderful experience!  Giulio was very knowledgeable and so patient with my friend and me. Camera issues slowed us down but he helped through it; encouraging us all the while.  We were able to photograph 6 sites and now have many wonderful images  to  cherish. I would highly recommend this experience!",
            "__typename": "AttractionsReview",
            "votes": null,
            "user": {
