        },
        {
            "epochMs": 1645370351000,
            "id": "masked_4ea08974-52f8-4bfb-8552-b6653bb613af",
            "content": "This tour is exactly what I wanted it to be.  We level set by having a conversation about my existing skill level and he taught at that level.  He helped me set up some phenominal shots.  Aside from night photography tips and composition, I did pick up a few new camera tips as well.  I felt like I was just walking around Rome with a photography friend.  The four hours flew by, really.\n\nOn a side note, Giulio is a genuinely nice man.  At the end of the tour, there was a problem with my transportation back to my hotel.  Not only did he not abandon me alone at midnight in Rome, but he actually helped me get a taxi back to the hotel.  I was grateful to have such a wonderful guide on this night.",
